/				  2) ADD PR3/0027/7777 TO SELECT SINGLE-CHAR
/				  FUNCTION KEY MODE;
/				  3) REMOVE MASK TO EIGHT BITS FOR CHARACTERS
/				  SENT TO USER (VIA KRB, ETC).
/ VERSION 401 - 04 MAY 84 - KAH - 1) ENSURE HARDWARE ERASE BITS ARE CLEARED
/				  AT THE FIRST AVAILABLE EOF (HAD CAUSED ED0 TO
/				  ACT AS ED2 SOMETIMES).
/ VERSION 400 - 01 MAY 84 - KAH - 1) BUMP REVISION TO INDICATE THAT WE RUN ON
/				  DECMATE III AND IV AS WELL AS DECMATE II.
/ VERSION 311 - 01 MAY 84 - KAH - 1) FIX CURSOR STYLE SETUP BUG.
/ VERSION 310 - 01 MAY 84 - KAH - 1) ENSURE CURSOR STYLE MAINTAINED IN SETUP
/				  BITS;
/				  2) MAKE C1-XMIT-INTRODUCER MODE INDEPENDENT OF
/				  LEVEL 2 MODE AND HOST-PORT-ENVIRONMENT (MUST
