/				  2) EXPAND EOFCTR DATA BLOCK, ADDING TWO WORDS
/				  AT THE END FOR OPERATING SYSTEMS TO STORE A
/				  DATE, INITIALIZED TO ZEROES;
/				  3) ADD PR3/0024/7777 TO ENABLE/DISABLE DECSTR,
/				  TO AVOID SIDE AFFECTS OF SELECTING TERMINAL
/				  MODE DURING SETUP;
/				  4) ADD PR3/0025/7777 TO ENABLE/DISABLE CURSOR
/				  VISIBILITY, ALLOWS SETUP TO SUPRESS CURSOR
/				  WITHOUT AFFECTING USER'S CURSOR SELECTION.

